  "Popular for columns, beams, trusses, canopies, warehouses, and modern architectural steel structures due to their strength and clean appearance.": "Popular para columnas, vigas, cerchas, marquesinas, almacenes y estructuras arquitectónicas modernas de acero debido a su resistencia y apariencia limpia.",
